Well, you can always eat the corpse.  Provided it's not spoiled, you
might (I said, might) gain intrinsic poison resistance.  You can apply
the horn to cure various ailments, such as any effects brought on by
poison.  

uncursed horns:  cure one thing at a time, and often don't do
	anything, though you don't lose a turn when that happens.

blessed horns: cures some things automatically, can cure more than one
	ailment per application

cursed horns: will *cause* ailments that horns normally cure.  Be very
	careful with these.

